<title>USA: Continental Airlines matches TWA sale.</title>
<headline>Continental Airlines matches TWA sale.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc said Tuesday it would match an air fare sale announced by Trans World Airlines Inc.</p>
<p>Continental said it will offer 60 percent discounts on fares in select U.S. and Canadian markets, for travel to be completed by December 18. Tickets must be purchased 14 days in advance and a Saturday night stay over is required, a Continental spokesowman said.</p>
<p>Fares are subject to change at any time, the spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
